Q Group Twitter\u3001Telegram Group and other links allow readers to jump to your place and achieve precise traffic diversion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/5ce14b9ab456a0e058a919cfc7c87cc6.avif?t=1762867767\" width=576 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect online books for creating book lists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/790029f5ba9e9dbf4c66f5edcf91bc6d.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect to forums, websites, etc. for traffic attraction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Component 7: Branch</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intra chapter branching component allows you to choose different storylines within the same chapter. If combined with the &quot;jump&quot; component, you can also jump to different chapters, achieving traditional branching novels! The Garden of Forking Paths will no longer be a dream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/0ba5e57da6e31a0c40a3ba11b9300210.avif?t=1762867767\" width=596 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Component 8: Jump</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jump component allows authors to set the desired chapter they want to jump to, which can be from their own book or another book (as long as you have access to its book) ID And articles ID\uff09\u3002 This function is mainly combined with branch components to jointly implement branch novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/b16be40c58b8fc5bd7302061d3e4ee29.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=786 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Function 1: Paragraph comments+End of chapter comments+Book review</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each paragraph and chapter can be commented upon at the end, and the book has a comment section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your comment/reply is liked or replied to by someone else, you will receive a notification</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy your desire for roast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/8e809248863cdcde29c03b02712108e9.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragraph comments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/bc6888a6db6eec4daa649cd82f1e2609.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bottom column of comments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/7228556873ec2b6e98da725bc50ea5f6.avif?t=1762867767\" width=588 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End of chapter comments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/bc6032611640145c32b58bd7800398e8.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Book Forum</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Function 2: Reader Annotations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When readers are reading, they can underline and annotate some names of people/things. When they see the same content later, clickable text will be displayed. Click to view the previous annotations and add or delete them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annotations can be selected in different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/2271853b9b955454216544ab25e216bf.avif?t=1762867767\" width=362 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/c46959e1dd9ed5416ae67953d1c97dac.avif?t=1762867767\" width=398 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/5f77361fc1893022f4c7533ed8c8ac34.avif?t=1762867767\" width=326 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/7a1d0c98c4b8a38db3263e3dd76324ae.avif?t=1762867767\" width=588 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click on the annotation to modify</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/2f90bd4107b751ab1e2689343b46c083.avif?t=1762867767\" width=590 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click on the homepage sidebar to enter the annotation management page</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381530/extras/bededaa424e8d35f1fa4b4fb36b3e5d9.avif?t=1762867767\" width=598 height=1070 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Annotations exist locally and can be imported or exported json Format data for easy sharing and migration</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature 1: Online novel sharing+offline novel sharing (through steam Creative Workshop</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Idea Bookroom supports online novel sharing (recommendation page) and offline novel sharing (creative workshop, only available) Steam Version support).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Supports converting online novel to offline novel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. online novels support from txt Import into draft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. offline novels also support from txt Import!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature 2: Publishing and Reading Books in One Software</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are an unrepentant pure reader, you can close the creation page in the sidebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to write, you can click on &quot;Become an Author&quot; in the sidebar, read the Author Notice, and become a proud creator!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature 3: The application supports multiple devices (Windows, Android, web)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current software support windows\u3001 Xiaomi/Google based Android web Web version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to technological reasons, the web version takes about 20 seconds to load for the first time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>It's like a cross era writing and reading platform ~~~</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fu